---
const pt = Astro.props.lang === "pt-br";
// the 404 beach: a plain sign, no match and no notebook
const notFound = Astro.props.notFound === true;
---
{notFound ? (
<div class="habitat-sign habitat-sign-off" role="img" aria-label="No matches today" data-pt-label="Sem jogos hoje">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 164 138" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <ellipse cx="88" cy="129" rx="65" ry="7" fill="#624a32" opacity=".17" />
    <g filter="url(#wobS)">
      <path d="M35 60 29 130 39 128 47 61M121 61 127 127 137 130 133 61" fill="#997249" />
      <path d="m6 8 151-3 2 91-151 5z" fill="#a78050" />
      <path d="m13 16 136-4 1 77-135 4z" fill="#304e47" />
      <path d="m15 21 131-4M16 88l132-4" fill="none" stroke="#d4b67c" opacity=".5" />
    </g>
    <g fill="#f6ebce" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="82" y="48" class="sign-off" data-pt="Sem jogos">No matches</text>
      <text x="82" y="74" class="sign-off" data-pt="hoje">today</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</div>
) : (
<>
<button class="habitat-sign" id="habitat-sign" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="habitat-notes" aria-label={pt ? "Abrir o caderno da IA na praia" : "Open the beach AI notebook"}>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 164 138" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <ellipse cx="88" cy="129" rx="65" ry="7" fill="#624a32" opacity=".17" />
    <g filter="url(#wobS)">
      <path d="M35 60 29 130 39 128 47 61M121 61 127 127 137 130 133 61" fill="#997249" />
      <path d="m6 8 151-3 2 91-151 5z" fill="#a78050" />
      <path d="m13 16 136-4 1 77-135 4z" fill="#304e47" />
      <path d="m15 21 131-4M16 88l132-4" fill="none" stroke="#d4b67c" opacity=".5" />
    </g>
    <g fill="#f6ebce" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="82" y="39" class="sign-title">Donald × {pt ? "Esposa" : "Wife"}</text>
      <text x="82" y="51" id="habitat-sign-games" class="sign-games">Games 0 × 0 · {pt ? "IA" : "AI"} ↗</text>
      <circle id="habitat-serve-dot" cx="19" cy="65" r="2" />
      <text x="82" y="69" id="habitat-sign-status" class="sign-score">0 × 0</text>
      <text x="82" y="83" id="habitat-sign-hint" class="sign-hint">{pt ? "Donald saca" : "Donald serves"}</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</button>
<dialog id="habitat-notes" class="habitat-notes" aria-labelledby="habitat-title">
  <div class="notes-binding" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <button id="habitat-close" class="notes-close" type="button" aria-label={pt ? "Fechar caderno" : "Close notebook"}>×</button>
  <p class="notes-kicker">Jurerê · {pt ? "caderno de campo" : "field notes"}</p>
  <h2 id="habitat-title">{pt ? "Uma praia com IA" : "A beach with a mind"}</h2>
  <p class="notes-intro">{pt ? "A IA sugere o ritmo da praia e as jogadas. O código cuida do movimento, do contato com a bola e das regras." : "AI suggests the beach rhythm and the shots. Code handles movement, ball contact, and the rules."}</p>
  <section class="match-summary" aria-label={pt ? "Placar da partida" : "Match score"}>
    <h3>{pt ? "Donald × Esposa" : "Donald × Wife"}</h3>
    <p id="habitat-match-score">Games 0 × 0 · {pt ? "Pontos" : "Points"} 0 × 0</p>
    <p id="habitat-match-status">{pt ? "Donald saca" : "Donald serves"}</p>
    <p class="notes-footnote">{pt ? "Exibição 1 contra 1 · um set. 15, 30, 40, game; ponto decisivo no 40–40. Set de 6 games com dois de vantagem; tie-break até 7 no 6–6, também com dois de vantagem. Um saque, sem let. Após o resultado, começa uma revanche." : "1 vs 1 exhibition · one set. 15, 30, 40, game; deciding point at 40–40. Six games with a two-game lead; at 6–6, tie-break to seven with a two-point lead. One serve, no let. A rematch follows the result."}</p>
  </section>
  <p id="habitat-latest" class="notes-mode"></p>
  <p id="habitat-mode" class="notes-mode"></p>
  <dl class="notes-tallies">
    <div><dt>{pt ? "tokens dos planos" : "tokens to prepare"}</dt><dd id="habitat-tokens">—</dd></div>
    <div><dt>{pt ? "jogadas nesta visita" : "shots this visit"}</dt><dd id="habitat-shots">0</dd></div>
    <div><dt>{pt ? "chamadas por jogada" : "calls per shot"}</dt><dd>0</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <h3>{pt ? "Quem está ajudando" : "Who's helping"}</h3>
  <div id="habitat-providers" class="notes-providers"></div>
  <p class="notes-footnote">{pt ? "Tokens informados pelos provedores para os planos em uso, reutilizados durante o jogo. Não é o consumo desta visita nem o total do site. Valores ausentes ficam como indisponíveis." : "Provider-reported tokens for the plans in use, reused during play. These are not visit charges or site-wide totals. Missing counts are shown as unavailable."}</p>
  <h3>{pt ? "À beira da quadra" : "From the sideline"}</h3>
  <p class="notes-footnote">{pt ? "Registro das ações executadas, não do raciocínio interno dos modelos." : "A log of actions actually played, not the models' private reasoning."}</p>
  <ol id="habitat-decisions" class="notes-decisions"><li>{pt ? "Esperando a próxima jogada." : "Waiting for the next shot."}</li></ol>
  <p class="notes-footer">{pt ? "Feito de sol, areia e pequenas decisões." : "Made of sunshine, sand, and small decisions."}</p>
</dialog>
</>
)}
<style>
  .habitat-sign { position: fixed; z-index: 3; left: calc(var(--ox, 0px) + var(--hb-x, 1400) * var(--fs, 1) * 1px); top: calc(var(--oy, 0px) + var(--hb-y, 558) * var(--fs, 1) * 1px); width: calc(var(--hb-w, 138) * 1px); padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; cursor: pointer; transform: translateX(-50%) scale(var(--fs, 1)) rotate(-3deg); transform-origin: 50% 0; color: #f6ebce; }
  .habitat-sign svg { display: block; width: 100%; overflow: visible; }
  .habitat-sign text { font: 700 17px var(--hand); }
  .habitat-sign .sign-title { font-size: 20px; }
  .habitat-sign .sign-games { font-size: 13px; }
  .match-summary { padding-block: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #9c8b664f; }
  .habitat-sign .sign-score { font-size: 28px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .habitat-sign .sign-hint { font-size: 13px; }
  .habitat-sign .sign-off { font-size: 27px; }
  .habitat-sign-off { cursor: default; }
  :global(html:not(.jb-ready)) .habitat-sign, :global(html[data-og]) .habitat-sign { visibility: hidden; }
  :global(html[data-panel]) .habitat-sign { visibility: hidden; }
  .habitat-notes { color: #37372d; background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 27px, #94866c13 27px 28px), #f7efd9; width: min(570px, calc(100vw - 32px)); max-height: calc(100svh - 40px); margin: auto; padding: 32px 34px 26px 42px; border: 1px solid #9e8960; border-radius: 4px 13px 13px 5px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #d5c6a0, 9px 9px 0 #8d7957, 0 24px 90px #1b29284d; overflow-y: auto; }
  .habitat-notes::backdrop { background: #23373142; }
  .notes-binding { position: absolute; left: 15px; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 6px; border-inline: 1px solid #aa63423d; }
  .notes-close { position: absolute; right: 12px; top: 9px; width: 40px; height: 40px; font: 30px var(--hand); cursor: pointer; border: 0; background: transparent; }
  .notes-kicker { font: 11px var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; color: #756449; }
  .habitat-notes h2 { font: 700 38px/1.08 var(--hand); margin: 8px 0 12px; }
  .notes-intro { font: 14px/1.65 var(--sans); max-width: 44ch; }
  .notes-mode { font: 700 20px var(--hand); margin: 16px 0; color: #3d6854; }
  .notes-tallies { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-block: 1px solid #9c8b664f; }
  .notes-tallies dt { font: 10px/1.5 var(--mono); }
  .notes-tallies dd { font: 700 30px/1.4 var(--hand); margin: 0; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .habitat-notes h3 { font: 700 25px var(--hand); margin: 20px 0 8px; }
  .notes-providers { display: grid; gap: 10px; font: 12px/1.6 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .notes-providers :global(p) { margin: 0; }
  .notes-providers :global(strong) { display: block; font: 700 16px var(--sans); }
  .notes-footnote { font: 11px/1.65 var(--sans); color: #6f6756; margin: 10px 0; }
  .notes-decisions { margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 20px; font: 16px/1.65 var(--hand); min-height: 52px; }
  .notes-footer { font: 18px var(--hand); color: #8b6545; margin-top: 22px; }
  @media (max-width: 819px) { .habitat-notes { padding: 30px 22px 22px 32px; } .habitat-notes h2 { font-size: 32px; } }
</style>
<script>
  import { initHabitatBoard } from "../../lib/habitat/display";
  initHabitatBoard();
</script>
